{"steam_appid":2633950,"steam_name":"Rugrats: Adventures in Gameland","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2633950/685902/f3fa04f84c03603ef59e6366c80d8f5924781bae/1750938107/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1712846761","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257015003/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1712846761","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/ss_9fe421098abbb1a2e3912f90ec6b94ca8a845d13.1920x1080.jpg?t=1732122113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/ss_0d52494cca973eba72fd1bf4d9868799ed83f0d7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1732122113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/ss_ee87de35c347632914a0421c2c76727ddf8f34d7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1732122113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/ss_087733ad0dec97784d9bbe13999992848de345c1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1732122113","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/ss_519431561e4dd5669d174959336af4bc78e2796f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1732122113"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/extras/0b36eac98e6d4e7b78e24562bfe7539b.poster.avif?t=1732122113\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/extras/0b36eac98e6d4e7b78e24562bfe7539b.webm?t=1732122113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/extras/0b36eac98e6d4e7b78e24562bfe7539b.mp4?t=1732122113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Everyone's favorite babies are back in action!  When Tommy, Chuckie, Phil and Lil see a commercial for the new Reptar video game, they pretend that they're in a video game of their own. Through the power of imagination, the babies transform Tommy's house into a video game world full of action, excitement, and adventure. Toggle between beautiful 8-bit and HD art, select your favorite baby and play this neo-retro platformer! Rugrats: Adventures in Gameland can be played solo, or team up with a friend for some two-player co-op fun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/extras/a8963aae83f8003771e7b5b74a747d72.poster.avif?t=1732122113\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/extras/a8963aae83f8003771e7b5b74a747d72.webm?t=1732122113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/extras/a8963aae83f8003771e7b5b74a747d72.mp4?t=1732122113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A baby's gotta do what a baby's gotta do!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 playable babies with unique abilities: Tommy, Chuckie, Phil and Lil!<br></li><li>Progress by grabbing Bottles, Cookies, Reptar Coins and more!<br></li><li>Play solo or in co-op, where babies need to stick together to win.<br></li><li>Toggle between nostalgic 8-bit or beautiful HD graphics.<br></li><li>Use your trusty screwdriver to enter engaging boss fights with familiar faces.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/extras/37526a3d05b8ecb429831c334a53dd6e.poster.avif?t=1732122113\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/extras/37526a3d05b8ecb429831c334a53dd6e.webm?t=1732122113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633950/extras/37526a3d05b8ecb429831c334a53dd6e.mp4?t=1732122113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core i3-6100 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 2GB or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core i5-8300 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 2GB or higher<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["The MIX Games","WALLRIDE"],"publishers":["The MIX Games"],"release_date":"10 Sep, 2024"}